[PrintTextModified Text:……孤身、一人……|#0105Bad02_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛喃喃自语，仿佛在说梦话。|#0105Bad02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……<br>温柔的艾玛小姐……你一定能理解我的，对吧？|#0105Bad02_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……她究竟在说些什么？<br>　我根本无法想像梅露露的心情）|#0105Bad02_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……但是，如果现在逃离梅露露的话<br>　……我会变成什么样呢）|#0105Bad02_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（连离开这个岛的方法都找不到。<br>　独自一人，躲躲藏藏）|#0105Bad02_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛脸色苍白，双手紧紧抱住<br>自己颤抖的身体。|#0105Bad02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful

[PrintTextModified Text:（肯定……只有死路一条……）|#0105Bad02_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（该怎么办……<br>　我完全不知道）|#0105Bad02_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走向梅露露，静静地低下了头。|#0105Bad02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:长达数十秒的沉默。|#0105Bad02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最后，用微弱的声音低语道。|#0105Bad02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我也和梅露露一样哦。|#0105Bad02_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我最讨厌孤单了。|#0105Bad02_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每句话之间<br>都隔了好几次呼吸那么长的停顿。|#0105Bad02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（咦……我在说什么啊）|#0105Bad02_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我知道自己在说什么吗？<br>　她明明把大家都杀了）|#0105Bad02_Ema010|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露突然靠近，抓住了艾玛的双肩，<br>仿佛要打断艾玛的内心挣扎。|#0105Bad02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:我就知道<br>艾玛小姐会这么说！|#0105Bad02_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你不想死对吧？<br>不想逃跑对吧？我们是朋友对吧？|#0105Bad02_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我当然理解你的烦恼。<br>感觉像是背叛了大家，很痛苦吧。|#0105Bad02_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露悲伤地垂下眼帘，<br>随后突然绽放笑容，拍了拍手。|#0105Bad02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:但没关系！<br>大家都死了。不幸中的万幸……！|#0105Bad02_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算背叛也没人会责备你。<br>所以你不会成为坏人。|#0105Bad02_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对艾玛小姐来说，安慰我<br>就是保持善良的唯一方法。|#0105Bad02_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……是、啊。<br>也许……是这样吧。|#0105Bad02_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful

[PrintTextModified Text:（……好恶心）|#0105Bad02_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她把大家的死当成什么了？<br>　这个人太奇怪了……）|#0105Bad02_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但是……无论如何……<br>　我都没有勇气拒绝）|#0105Bad02_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（因为这只手，一定是我人生中<br>　最后一次朝我伸来的救赎）|#0105Bad02_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛轻轻握住梅露露的手，<br>勉强挤出一丝僵硬的微笑。|#0105Bad02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……梅露露。|#0105Bad02_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛将自己的手覆在<br>抓住自己肩膀的梅露露的手上。|#0105Bad02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:用微弱的、颤抖的声音，<br>犹豫着……|#0105Bad02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:压抑住所有的情感，<br>挤出了那句话。|#0105Bad02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……救救我。|#0105Bad02_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯。|#0105Bad02_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到艾玛的话，<br>梅露露也静静地微笑着，流下了一滴眼泪。|#0105Bad02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐……受拯救的是我才对。|#0105Bad02_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:到现在为止，<br>从来没有人愿意靠近我。|#0105Bad02_Meruru010| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直以来，我都很寂寞……<br>但大家的死并非毫无意义。|#0105Bad02_Meruru011| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:因为，我遇到了这么棒的朋友。|#0105Bad02_Meruru012| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露害羞地笑了。|#0105Bad02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯，嗯。|#0105Bad02_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是梅露露温柔地将艾玛抱在怀里。<br>艾玛静静地不断点头。|#0105Bad02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:我好高兴……<br>以前从来没有过这样的事。|#0105Bad02_Meruru013| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（已经什么都搞不明白了。<br>　脑海中的思绪一片混乱）|#0105Bad02_Ema019|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（总之……必须要接受<br>　梅露露）|#0105Bad02_Ema020|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我不能抛弃她。<br>　否则，我就……）|#0105Bad02_Ema021|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:你不会抛弃我吧？|#0105Bad02_Meruru014| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯。|#0105Bad02_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:……艾玛小姐……！<br>我大概，一定不会杀你的！|#0105Bad02_Meruru015| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:"（是啊。<br>　梅露露说话的时候是很温和的……）|#0105Bad02_Ema023|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她总是为别人着想，<br>　是个能为他人流泪的，温柔的人……）|#0105Bad02_Ema024|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（所以……我没有搞错。<br>　这是正确的选择）|#0105Bad02_Ema025|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（现在，把内心放空吧）|#0105Bad02_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛回应着拥抱自己的梅露露，<br>将手臂环绕在她的背上。|#0105Bad02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……我们一起寻找大魔女吧。|#0105Bad02_Ema027| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……可以吗？|#0105Bad02_Meruru016| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……当然。<br>我也想解开诅咒。|#0105Bad02_Ema028| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真让人安心……<br>至今，我都是一个人思考和做着各种事情。|#0105Bad02_Meruru017| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:我们马上……<br>准备迎接下一批预备魔女吧。|#0105Bad02_Ema029| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了能尽快找到大魔女。|#0105Bad02_Ema030| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和梅露露手牵着手，<br>一起离开了审判庭。|#0105Bad02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

