[PrintTextModified Text:新来的人，听说是单亲家庭，我调查了一下，<br>她父亲因为债务自杀了。|#0105Bad02_Ema031| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这有什么问题吗？|#0105Bad02_Meruru018| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们偷走另一个人的重要物品吧。<br>嫁祸给她，然后要求她归还。|#0105Bad02_Ema032| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这大概会让她想起父亲的事，<br>刺激到她的心理创伤。|#0105Bad02_Ema033| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:哇，太棒了！<br>这样的话魔女化应该会马上得到触发。|#0105Bad02_Meruru019| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。<br>其他人的心理创伤也要好好调查……|#0105Bad02_Ema034| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:平淡地说完后，<br>艾玛突然停住了呼吸，惊讶地睁大了眼睛。|#0105Bad02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:（说起来，最近我什么都感觉不到了……）|#0105Bad02_Ema035| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管在制定伤害陌生人的计划，<br>艾玛的心却没有丝毫痛苦或罪恶感。|#0105Bad02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就像平静的海面一样。<br>安静而平和。|#0105Bad02_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（多亏如此，我似乎不用担心会变成魔女了）|#0105Bad02_Ema036| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果一直纠结下去就没完没了，<br>　没办法啊，没办法……）|#0105Bad02_Ema037|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，艾玛小姐最近笑得更多了呢。<br>我很高兴。|#0105Bad02_Meruru020| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？我在笑吗？|#0105Bad02_Ema038| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你没注意到吗？<br>现在也是，脸上露出了开心的表情哦。|#0105Bad02_Meruru021| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我，看起来很开心……？）|#0105Bad02_Ema039| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛摸了摸自己的脸颊，<br>确实感觉嘴角上扬了。|#0105Bad02_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:刚好收到了下一批人选的资料，<br>待会能一起看看吗……？|#0105Bad02_Meruru022| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:当然可以。|#0105Bad02_Ema040| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛微笑着点头，<br>梅露露似乎松了一口气。|#0105Bad02_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐果然很可靠。<br>我一个人的话，是想不到这么多的……|#0105Bad02_Meruru023| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:只要我能帮上忙就好。|#0105Bad02_Ema041| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛高兴地说着，握住了梅露露的手。|#0105Bad02_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:距离下一批预备魔女到来还有一点时间，<br>我们一起努力准备吧。|#0105Bad02_Ema042| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:好的。<br>这次一定要找到大魔女大人。|#0105Bad02_Meruru024| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:之后过了一段时间，<br>新的预备魔女们来到了监牢。|#0105Bad02_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

