[PrintTextModified Text:这是什么鬼地方啊！|#0105Bad02_WitchCandidate1001| AuthorId:WitchCandidate1 RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想回家。|#0105Bad02_WitchCandidate2001| AuthorId:WitchCandidate2 RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……吵死了。<br>别叽叽喳喳的。|#0105Bad02_WitchCandidate3001| AuthorId:WitchCandidate3 RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在久违地喧闹起来的监牢里，<br>艾玛和梅露露混在其他预备魔女中，<br>默默观察着情况。|#0105Bad02_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……真怀念我第一次来这里的那天啊）|#0105Bad02_Ema043| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那天，大家也像今天这样<br>各自表露着心中的慌乱。|#0105Bad02_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（但是，现在已经和那时不同了）|#0105Bad02_Ema044| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在的艾玛，是以管理者的身份待在了这里。|#0105Bad02_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（希望大魔女就在这些人中间）|#0105Bad02_Ema045| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正当艾玛这么想着时，<br>梅露露拉了拉她的袖子。|#0105Bad02_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么了？|#0105Bad02_Ema046| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:其他预备魔女开始向会客厅走去。<br>在队伍的最后，艾玛和梅露露<br>悄悄交谈着。|#0105Bad02_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:那个，我……能做好吗？|#0105Bad02_Meruru025| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:不用担心。<br>这次有我和你一起。|#0105Bad02_Ema047| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:眼神略显暗淡的艾玛微笑着，握住了梅露露的手。|#0105Bad02_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:两人的手指紧紧交缠，<br>仿佛在探寻对方的体温，不愿放开。|#0105Bad02_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我最喜欢梅露露了。|#0105Bad02_Ema048| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:我也最喜欢艾玛小姐了。|#0105Bad02_Meruru026| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听到梅露露的回应，<br>艾玛加重了握手的力度。|#0105Bad02_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛注视着走在走廊上的<br>预备魔女们的背影。|#0105Bad02_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知道下一次听到惨叫声会是什么时候。<br>下一次听到求饶声又会是什么时候。|#0105Bad02_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这仿佛永无止境的循环中，<br>除了被握住的手的温暖，一切都似乎是虚幻的。|#0105Bad02_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛决定永远不放开这只确实存在的手，<br>继续走在这条昏暗的道路上。|#0105Bad02_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而代价，就是她们的生命。|#0105Bad02_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

